{"id": 78089, "field": "objectives", "ja": "Althalaxx OrbをStormwindのKatherine the Pureに届ける。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-b70245-obj-sg12@2026-10-07", "imported": "2026-10-07"}, "english": {"hash": "3b4d2dbdaface4f8", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70291"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 78089, "field": "description", "ja": "このorbには強大な闇がまとわりついている。その性質は明らかに悪魔のものだが、それ以上となると、目的を見極めるのは私の力では無理だ。\n\nこのorbを、Stormwind CathedralにいるKatherine the Pureと呼ばれる方のところへ持って行ってくれ。orbについて彼女に助言を求めるといい。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-b70245-desc-a-sg12@2026-10-07", "imported": "2026-10-07"}, "english": {"hash": "789ee65ce492d7b2", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70291"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
