{"id": 78823, "field": "objectives", "ja": "Primitive DrawingをStranglethorn ValeのHemet Nesingwaryに届ける。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-b70245-obj-sg12@2026-10-07", "imported": "2026-10-07"}, "english": {"hash": "ee6d5c939124ed1a", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70291"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 78823, "field": "description", "ja": "このdrawingは粗く太い筆致で描かれており、大きな猛禽を表しているようだ。単純な構図だが、描き手がこの生き物を恐れ、畏敬していたことは明らかだ。大物の獲物に詳しい者なら、もっと詳しく教えてくれるだろう。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-b70245-desc-a-sg12@2026-10-07", "imported": "2026-10-07"}, "english": {"hash": "946d35b23b1d533f", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70291"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
