{"id": 78916, "field": "description", "ja": "恐るべき獣Aku'maiは息絶えた。膨れ上がった死骸の臓物と血肉の中に、生のVoidエネルギーに満ちた巨大な虹色の真珠が隠されている。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-b70245-desc-a-sg12@2026-10-07", "imported": "2026-10-07"}, "english": {"hash": "0a93b80a8d1cb4b5", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70291"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
